<v Daniel>So it can't just be like a computer science degree over here and a business degree over there.</v>

156
00:19:03.041 --> 00:19:14.484
<v Maya>No, it has to be integrated. It also means universities must aggressively partner with employers. Because remember, the paper's entire proof of causality relied on talent pipelines between specific universities and firms.</v>

