00:19:14.704 --> 00:19:14.924
<v Daniel>Right.</v>

158
00:19:15.264 --> 00:19:27.247
<v Maya>Higher education institutions need to rethink how they credential this blended skill set and build direct bridges into these AI investing companies. Because those companies desperately need domain experts who know how to build organization capital.</v>

159
00:19:27.647 --> 00:19:37.989
<v Daniel>Wow. Let's bring it all together. Our journey today showed us that AI productivity is incredibly real, but it has been hidden behind the long dip of the productivity J curve.</v>

