00:19:38.409 --> 00:19:38.869
<v Maya>Exactly.</v>

161
00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:48.376
<v Daniel>And those massive 1% a year gains strictly belong to the firms that use human talent to build deep, firm-specific organization capital.</v>

