<v Daniel>Okay, let's hear it.</v>

164
00:19:53.197 --> 00:20:05.663
<v Maya>If AI's true, proven value is codifying a firm's unique internal knowledge, then the proliferation of generic, off-the-shelf AI tools won't actually give companies a lasting competitive advantage.</v>

